<title>JAPAN: Shinko Kosan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Kosan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.08		vs	   12.40</p>
<p> Operating	    2.32		vs	    2.22</p>
<p> Current	    525    million	  vs	  888    million</p>
<p> Net		  263    million	  vs	  319    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.29 yen	  vs	   22.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinko Kosan Ltd is a real estate sales and leasing firm.</p>
